WEBVTT

00:00:08.187 --> 00:00:11.440
No one outsmarts Orson!
没人能智胜奥森

00:00:12.149 --> 00:00:14.777
Now, we're gonna have to play
a little game called
这样一来 我们来玩个游戏吧

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.904
"drop goes the weasel."
名字就叫“黄鼠狼倒下了”

00:00:16.987 --> 00:00:20.032
It means, take down Buck!
意思就是击败巴克

00:00:20.532 --> 00:00:23.369
[shouts] Oh, my-- Geez.
天啊 真是的

00:00:23.452 --> 00:00:25.913
What did I say about boundaries, huh?
我没教过你要尊重私人空间吗

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.874
And you! Stop copying me!
还有你 不许学我说话

00:00:38.926 --> 00:00:41.887
It's not safe here, girl.
Better take off for the night.
这里不安全 丫头
你还是去别的地方过夜吧

00:00:41.971 --> 00:00:43.097
[chitters]

00:00:44.056 --> 00:00:45.307
Be careful.
要注意安全哦

00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:46.767
[squawks]

00:00:49.895 --> 00:00:50.980
Where to next, Buck?
接下来去哪里 巴克？

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.982
We're already here.
我们已经到了

00:00:53.065 --> 00:00:54.358
-[thuds]
-[both scream]

00:00:54.441 --> 00:00:56.443
[screaming continues]

00:00:57.695 --> 00:01:01.865
[camera shutter clicking]

00:01:07.288 --> 00:01:08.914
-[thudding]
-[Eddie grunts]

00:01:18.591 --> 00:01:20.467
Buck's bachelor den!
巴克的单身小窝

00:01:22.177 --> 00:01:23.512
Wow.
哇塞

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.891
Talk about a possum paradise.
这里简直就是负鼠的天堂

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.311
Hang on.
Gotta pay the cucumber for babysitting.
等一下 得付黄瓜当保姆的钱

00:01:31.562 --> 00:01:35.232
Crash, wouldn't it be awesome
if we could live here with Buck?
克拉什 要是我们能
跟巴克一起住在这里 那岂不是很棒？

00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:36.942
Look, I know I said
it was gonna be three hours,
我知道我之前说是三小时

00:01:37.026 --> 00:01:38.110
but it was only two, and--
但其实只有两小时
你什么都没做的那一小时

00:01:38.193 --> 00:01:40.988
I'm not gonna pay for an hour
where you didn't do anything.
但其实只有两小时
你什么都没做的那一小时

00:01:41.071 --> 00:01:43.574
-He's got everything.
-[Buck] I'll pay you for three.
-他这里什么都有
-我付你三小时就是了

00:01:43.657 --> 00:01:45.743
You drive a hard bargain
for a salad pincher.
作为一颗菜 你还真会讨价还价

00:01:45.826 --> 00:01:48.579
Right, I just hope you didn't spend
the whole time talking to your boyfriend.
但愿你没有把时间
都花在跟男朋友聊天上

00:01:48.662 --> 00:01:50.956
[both yelp]
但愿你没有把时间
都花在跟男朋友聊天上

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:52.541
You remember my daughter?
你们还记得我女儿吗

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:54.001
Bronwyn!
布朗温

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:58.839
She's gotten so big and round, and big.
她都长这么大啦 又圆…又大

00:01:58.923 --> 00:02:00.424
These are your uncle possums.
他们是你的负鼠叔叔

00:02:00.925 --> 00:02:03.677
She doesn't remember you
because she was so young.
她不记得你们了 因为她当时太小了

00:02:03.761 --> 00:02:05.179
And also 'cause she's a squash.
还因为她是只南瓜

00:02:05.262 --> 00:02:09.683
Buck, I know you like living alone here
with your farm-fresh daughter,
巴克 我知道你喜欢
和你的新鲜农产品女儿在这里独居

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:12.645
but wouldn't it be nice
to have a couple of roommates?
但有几个室友难道不好吗

00:02:12.728 --> 00:02:14.188
Free pumpkin care.
免费帮你照顾南瓜

00:02:14.271 --> 00:02:15.981
And we charge less than cucumbers.
而且我们比黄瓜的收费更便宜

00:02:16.065 --> 00:02:19.652
Sorry, boys. I'm a solo operator
who can't be tied down.
抱歉 小伙子们 我是个无牵无挂的独行侠

00:02:19.735 --> 00:02:22.196
You can stay until I've stopped Orson,
but after that,
你们可以留下来 直到我阻止奥森

00:02:22.279 --> 00:02:24.949
I'm gonna find a way to get you back home.
但在那之后 我会想办法送你们回家

00:02:25.032 --> 00:02:27.576
Well, maybe we could help you stop Orson.
或许我们可以帮你阻止奥森

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.411
Dude, up top!
哥们 来击个掌

00:02:30.079 --> 00:02:31.747
[hollow thud, clatters, bounces]

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:35.751
[flap, creaks, bounces, crashes]

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:37.294
[creaking]

00:02:38.462 --> 00:02:39.755
[sighs]

00:02:41.382 --> 00:02:42.675
Crash!
克拉什

00:02:42.758 --> 00:02:43.801
Eddie!
埃迪

00:02:44.301 --> 00:02:48.389
I don't mean to be a negative Nancy,
but they've been gone a while.
我也不想说丧气话
但他们已经离开好一阵子了

00:02:48.472 --> 00:02:51.475
Shouldn't we just be
looking for bones at this point?
我们现在该找的难道不是骨头渣吗？

00:02:52.893 --> 00:02:55.521
I respectfully withdraw the question.
我恭敬地收回这个问题

00:02:56.146 --> 00:02:57.147
Hey, Über-tracker,
优步追踪器 你闻到他们的气味了吗？

00:02:57.231 --> 00:02:58.816
-you picked up that scent yet?
-[Diego sniffs]
优步追踪器 你闻到他们的气味了吗？

00:02:58.899 --> 00:03:02.736
Aside from you,
nothing smells bad. So, no.
除了你 没有其他难闻的气味
所以说还没找到

00:03:03.904 --> 00:03:08.075
Manny, they're out there all alone
in the cold. They're probably frightened.
曼尼 天寒地冻
他们孤身在外 他们可能吓坏了

00:03:08.158 --> 00:03:10.869
Look, don't worry. We'll find them.
别担心 我们会找到他们的

00:03:10.953 --> 00:03:14.123
Because if we don't find them,
I'm gonna kill them.
因为要是找不到的话
我就要了他们的小命

00:03:14.206 --> 00:03:15.207
[grunts]

00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:18.502
It's a figure of speech. And ow!
这只是种修辞方法 而且…

00:03:24.675 --> 00:03:25.843
Ha, ha, ha!

00:03:25.926 --> 00:03:28.512
[imitating Buck]
You've got nowhere to run, Orson!
你已经无路可逃啦 奥森

00:03:29.263 --> 00:03:32.182
Or should I say Shmorson.
还是说应该叫你“屎莫森”

00:03:32.266 --> 00:03:33.267
[gasps]

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.476
[grunts]

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.937
[groans]

00:03:37.021 --> 00:03:38.731
-[grunts]
-[objects clattering]

00:03:39.398 --> 00:03:42.902
So, how are you gonna defeat
this Shmorson dude anyway?
那么 你到底要如何打败
这个叫“屎莫森”的家伙呢

00:03:42.985 --> 00:03:44.737
That is a good question, Crash.
这个问题问得好 克拉什

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.156
-I'm Eddie, the handsome one.
-Right.
-我是埃迪 长得帅的那个
-对哦

00:03:47.239 --> 00:03:49.450
Back in the day,
Orson was tough on his own.
以前奥森虽然难缠 但毕竟只有一个人

00:03:49.533 --> 00:03:51.368
But now he's got some trained raptors,
可现在他有了训练有素的猛龙跟班

00:03:51.452 --> 00:03:54.455
taking him down
is gonna be a little bit trickier.
要制服他就稍微困难一些

00:03:54.538 --> 00:03:56.123
Why is he such a meanie anyway?
他到底为什么这么坏呀？

00:03:56.206 --> 00:03:57.583
Another good question, Eddie.
这个问题也问得好 埃迪

00:03:57.666 --> 00:03:59.460
I'm Crash, the other handsome one.
我是克拉什 另一个长得帅的

00:03:59.543 --> 00:04:03.923
When he was young, Orson was teased
and got all insecure about his big head.
奥森小时候总是被嘲笑
所以对自己的大头感到很自卑

00:04:04.006 --> 00:04:06.300
The bigger his head grew,
so too did his brain.
他的头长得越大 脑子就越大

00:04:06.383 --> 00:04:09.303
And he realized
that this was his greatest strength.
于是他意识到 这其实是他最大的优势

00:04:09.386 --> 00:04:13.224
But he came to believe
he was superior to everyone else.
但渐渐地 他开始觉得
自己比其他所有动物都更优越

00:04:13.307 --> 00:04:15.184
I tried to show him we were all equals.
我试图让他明白 我们都是平等的

00:04:15.267 --> 00:04:18.229
I even invited him to be part of
this team I belonged to.
我甚至邀请他加入我们的团队

00:04:20.564 --> 00:04:22.566
[Buck] We established the watering hole
as a place
我们建立了饮水坑乐园

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:26.070
where all species
could learn to peacefully coexist.
让各种各样的动物们在这里学习和平共处

00:04:26.779 --> 00:04:29.531
-[dinosaur rumbles]
-My team was dedicated to protecting it
我的团队致力于保护这个乐园

00:04:29.615 --> 00:04:32.660
and making sure all animals down here
lived in harmony.
并确保大家在这里和睦相处

00:04:32.743 --> 00:04:33.786
[clink]
并确保大家在这里和睦相处

00:04:34.411 --> 00:04:35.829
Whoa!

00:04:36.455 --> 00:04:38.082
Like a superhero squad?
就像个超级英雄小队吗

00:04:38.165 --> 00:04:41.418
Well, I wouldn't use the term "superhero."
我倒是不会用“超级英雄”这个词

00:04:41.502 --> 00:04:44.463
I mean, I wouldn't stop you
from using it. Anyway.
但你们要说我也不会拦着 言归正传

00:04:45.673 --> 00:04:47.424
[Buck] Orson turned down my offer.
奥森拒绝了我的邀请

00:04:49.009 --> 00:04:50.010
[screaming]

00:04:50.094 --> 00:04:51.679
He didn't believe in harmony.
他不信什么和睦相处

00:04:51.762 --> 00:04:55.057
He believed in a world
where the strong dominate the weak.
他信奉的是一个强者支配弱者的世界

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.602
Hello! Can you repeat that?
你能再说一遍吗
刚才我耳朵里塞了棉花糖

00:04:58.686 --> 00:05:00.563
-[pop]
-I had a marshmallow in my ear.
你能再说一遍吗
刚才我耳朵里塞了棉花糖

00:05:01.063 --> 00:05:02.773
I said…
我说…

00:05:02.856 --> 00:05:04.441
-Orson believed in a world…
-[all scream]
奥森信奉的是一个

00:05:04.525 --> 00:05:08.612
…where the strong dominate the weak,
and that he should dominate all.
强者支配弱者的世界
而他就该是一切的主宰

00:05:09.989 --> 00:05:15.369
And since I stood in his way,
he set a trap to get rid of me.
因为我挡了他的道
他便设下陷阱要除掉我

00:05:15.869 --> 00:05:16.912
[whooshing]

